  "title": "FSSAI Proposes Front-of-Pack Red-Pictorial Warnings for Foods High in Nutrients",
  "summary": "The FSSAI (Food and Drug Administration) has proposed front-of-pack red pictorial warnings for foods high in fat, sugar, and salt, aiming to inform consumers about these ingredients. The policy is intended to enhance food safety and consumer awareness.",
